    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "(Laughter) I'm sure you're trying to figure out, \"Well, how does this thing work?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EB1C17ACD2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "Well, what I'm doing is controlling the pitch with my left hand.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "831C84641B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 5,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "the closer I get to this antenna, the higher the note gets",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0CF4DF21D6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 50,
        "endOffset": 106,
        "text": "the further away my right hand gets, the louder it gets.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DC8A950137",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 22,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "with both of your hands",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E643465BC3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 104,
        "endOffset": 123,
        "text": "create the illusion",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8126E73564",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 13,
        "text": "(Flourish ...)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "09995E5A3E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 29,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "startle myself",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4008E449A8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "it's like a funny sound effect that follows you around",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A7D3A9330E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "Maybe we'll go into the next tune, because I totally lost where this is going.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6141367F02",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 80,
        "endOffset": 145,
        "text": "maybe I'll have words come back into me afterwards if I can relax",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C2D892248B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 19,
        "endOffset": 111,
        "text": "So, I'm trying to think of some of the questions that are commonly asked; there are so many.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "29198968C6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 7,
        "text": "And ...",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D0632178C4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 14,
        "endOffset": 70,
        "text": "I could tell you a little of the history of the theremin",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B178900D4A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 219,
        "text": "It was invented around the 1920s, and the inventor, Léon Theremin -- he also was a musician besides an inventor -- he came up with the idea for making the theremin, I think, when he was working on some shortwave radios.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "88AB998143",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 43,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "it's like (Screeching)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9A64DB0FFD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 86,
        "endOffset": 188,
        "text": "Oh, what if I could control that sound and turn it into an instrument, because there are pitches in it",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A58B8998CE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "And so somehow through developing that, he eventually came to make the theremin the way it is now.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "496C2D6D3A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 40,
        "endOffset": 194,
        "text": "they'll make reference to a theremin by going, \"Whoo-hoo-hoo-hoo,\" because in the '50s it was used in the sci-fi horror movies, that sound that's like ...",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "90E22C2007",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 29,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "It's kind of a funny, goofy sound to do.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F905C69140",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "And sometimes if I have too much coffee, then my vibrato gets out of hand.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "015F3AFF5D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 85,
        "text": "You're really sensitive to your body and its functions when you're behind this thing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9892991974",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "You have to stay so still if you want to have the most control.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DB0E5F45ED",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "It reminds me of the balancing act earlier on -- what Michael was doing",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "19CAA07769",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 83,
        "endOffset": 291,
        "text": "you're fighting so hard to keep the balance with what you're playing with and stay in tune, and at the same time you don't want to focus so much on being in tune all the time; you want to be feeling the music",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A0ADD28C17",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 37,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "very, very, very still",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F20A7A8C5C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "If I pass out on the next song ...",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E31750C363",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 25,
        "endOffset": 59,
        "text": "almost like like a yoga instrument",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C870D758A1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 68,
        "endOffset": 210,
        "text": "it makes you so aware of every little crazy thing your body is doing, or just aware of what you don't want it to be doing while you're playing",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D042FC5B2F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "And if I go to a club and play a gig, people are like, \"Here, have some drinks on us!\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3F93358308",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "And it's like, \"Well, I'm about to go on soon; I don't want to be like -- (Teetering tones) -- you know?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C821569E66",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 72,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "similar to being a vocalist",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "72EB086F95",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 156,
        "endOffset": 186,
        "text": "controlling it just in the air",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "83E949F315",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 53,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "if you're ...",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B3BB1A3D13",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 199,
        "text": "You just have to always adjust to what's happening and realize you'll have bummer notes come here and there and listen to it, adjust it, and just move on, or else you'll get too tied up and go crazy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CB3B5B79A2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 8,
        "text": "Like me.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AD15CC03A6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "I think we will play another tune now.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "072A532300",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "I'm going to do \"Lush Life.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3BF6365DAF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "It's one of my favorite tunes to play.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7431D24BB2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
